{"id":"n68756-19-3","stage":0,"title":"서다 · 排","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68756-19-3-1","ko":"공연장 안으로 들어가려고 하는데요.","zh":"我正要进演出厅呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공연장","meaning":"剧场，演出场地","explanation":"공연장：剧场，演出场地。","readings":[{"term":"공연장","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25333","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연장","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3"}},{"text":"안으로","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안으로","audio":"/audio/f58e9a42177825301954.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가려고","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가려고","audio":"/audio/248aaadd16984dba284c.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데요","audio":"/audio/680c4e006f96eb3e103f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"607077062c5e900a","term":"공연장","zh":"剧场，演出场地","audio":"/audio/607077062c5e900a7010.mp3","entryId":"25333","definition":"表演戏剧、歌曲、舞蹈等的地方。","pronunciation":["공연장"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","